+ * THE SANDBOX IS NOT ENFORCED ON EVERY PLATFORM. Verified on agy 1.1.28,
+ * macOS: under --sandbox, writes to the working tree are overlaid and
+ * discarded, and every path outside the workspace fails with EPERM for read
+ * *and* write. Verified on agy 1.4.4, Windows: --sandbox confines NOTHING —
+ * writes inside the workspace persisted, and writes outside it persisted too.
